fix(boardduel): F-003 difficulty chip </button> leak + F-004 mobile overflow

- F-003: esbuild HTML minify dropped the '<' of </button> for the 4 game pages'
  difficulty buttons (data-level + raw text), rendering 'Easy/button>' as
  literal text. Wrap each label in <span> (same structure as the surviving
  mode cards) so esbuild no longer mangles it. Verified: 4 games desktop +
  mobile show diffs=[Easy,Medium,Hard], body leak=false.
- F-004: the 45px mobile horizontal overflow was largely caused by the leaked
  '/button>' text widening the buttons; also add flex-wrap to .bd-diff-row and
  overflow-x:hidden + hero compact on <=560px as belt-and-suspenders.
  Verified: 390px viewport overflowX=0 on all 4 games.
